---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Hebei Wire Mesh Factory: Beyond Anping";
const description = "Hebei Province's wire mesh industry extends beyond Anping County. Explore regional specializations, logistics advantages, and how to evaluate Hebei manufacturers.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Hebei Wire Mesh: Regional Overview</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        While Anping County dominates Hebei's wire mesh production, other regions offer
        distinct advantages. Understanding the full landscape helps you source strategically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">Home</a> / Hebei Wire Mesh
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Hebei Context -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Hebei's Wire Mesh Industry</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Hebei Province surrounds Beijing and Tianjin, giving it exceptional logistics access
        to China's capital region and major ports. The province's industrial base includes
        steel production, metal processing, and wire mesh manufacturing—creating natural
        vertical integration.
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Key characteristics of Hebei wire mesh manufacturing:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Raw material access</strong> — Proximity to major steel producers reduces wire costs</li>
        <li><strong>Port logistics</strong> — Tianjin Port (Xingang) handles significant wire mesh exports</li>
        <li><strong>Industrial clustering</strong> — Supporting industries (galvanizing, PVC coating, packaging) co-located</li>
        <li><strong>Cost structure</strong> — Lower land and labor costs than coastal regions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Regional Specializations -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Regional Specializations</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Different areas of Hebei have developed distinct wire mesh specializations:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Region</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Specialization</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Anping County</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">All wire mesh types</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Industry center, widest product range</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Hengshui Area</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Rubber-coated mesh, specialty products</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Emerging cluster, some innovation focus</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Shijiazhuang</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Distribution, trading companies</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Provincial capital, logistics hub</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Tianjin Corridor</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Export processing, port logistics</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Convenient for export-focused orders</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hebei vs Other Regions -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Hebei vs. Other Manufacturing Regions</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        How does Hebei compare to other Chinese wire mesh manufacturing regions?
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Region</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Strengths</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">Considerations</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Hebei (Anping)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Complete supply chain, competitive pricing, product variety</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Quality varies widely; due diligence essential</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Jiangsu (Nantong)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Higher precision mesh, technical textiles</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Higher prices, smaller scale for standard products</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Guangdong</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Export experience, proximity to Hong Kong logistics</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Higher costs, less specialization in wire mesh</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">Zhejiang</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">General metal products, trading networks</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">Less wire mesh specialization</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Evaluating Hebei Factories -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Evaluating Hebei Wire Mesh Factories</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Regardless of specific location, these factors help distinguish reliable Hebei manufacturers:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Production Equipment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Modern weaving machines (Swiss or German looms for precision mesh),
            consistent wire drawing capability, in-house galvanizing lines.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Quality Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            ISO 9001 certification is common among export-oriented factories.
            Ask for quality manuals and recent third-party audit reports.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Export Track Record</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Request references from buyers in your region. Established exporters
            should provide contactable references.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Technical Capability</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Can they produce to international standards (ASTM, DIN, JIS)?
            Do they understand your application's requirements?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Logistics -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Logistics from Hebei</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Hebei's location offers several shipping options:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Tianjin Port (Xingang)</strong> — Primary export gateway, ~2-3 hours from Anping</li>
        <li><strong>Qingdao Port</strong> — Alternative for shipments to South America and Africa</li>
        <li><strong>Shanghai Port</strong> — Used for some consolidated shipments</li>
        <li><strong>Rail options</strong> — China-Europe rail for landlocked destinations</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">
        Most factories handle export documentation, but clarify responsibilities
        (EXW, FOB, CIF terms) before ordering. Our <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">sourcing guide</a> covers
        Incoterms in detail.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Continue Exploring</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/anping-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Anping Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Deep dive into the industry's center</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Sourcing Guide</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Step-by-step procurement process</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/procurement-process/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Procurement Process</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">RFQ to delivery workflow</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/factory-directory/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Factory Directory</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Browse verified manufacturers</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Sourcing from Hebei?</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">Send your requirements. We'll help you find the right manufacturer.</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        Send Inquiry
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
